# REST style

@baseUrl = http://{{host}}:{{nginxPublishedPort}}/api/v1
@createNotificationUrl = {{baseUrl}}/notification

### Request 1 - позитивный сценарий
### fetch 503 → 200 (задержка 15с), email доставлен → completed
POST {{createNotificationUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

{
  "orderId": 1000,
  "orderEvent": "created",
  "channel": "email",
  "recipient": "test@example.com"
}

### Request 2 - не удалось получить данные по заказу
### fetch 503 → retry → drop, до отправки не дойдёт → failed
POST {{createNotificationUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

{
  "orderId": 2000,
  "orderEvent": "paid",
  "channel": "sms",
  "recipient": "+79269788807"
}

### Request 3 - SMS с задержкой
### fetch 200 (задержка 15с), доставка на +40700000003 (пауза 3с) → 200 → completed
POST {{createNotificationUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

{
  "orderId": 3000,
  "orderEvent": "shipped",
  "channel": "sms",
  "recipient": "+40700000003"
}

### Request 4 - SMS с таймаутом
### fetch 200 (задержка 15с), доставка на +40700000006 → timeout 30с, 504 → retry/failed
POST {{createNotificationUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

{
  "orderId": 4000,
  "orderEvent": "shipped",
  "channel": "sms",
  "recipient": "+40700000006"
}

### Request 5 - SMS на обычный РФ-номер
### fetch 503 → 200 (задержка 15с), SMS доставлен сразу → completed
POST {{createNotificationUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

{
  "orderId": 5000,
  "orderEvent": "created",
  "channel": "sms",
  "recipient": "+79269788807"
}

### Request 6 - негативный сценарий валидации
### orderId строкой, orderEvent не поддерживается → ошибки валидации 422
POST {{createNotificationUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache

{
  "orderId": "6000",
  "orderEvent": "in-progress",
  "channel": "email",
  "recipient": "test@example.com"
}
